DATA NOTICE

The MIT License above covers the FlameLens source code only.

The tables in `data/curated/` are derived from the NASA Physical Sciences
Informatics (PSI) repository (https://psi.nasa.gov). The PSI records for the
investigations used here state the license as CC0-1.0 (Creative Commons Zero,
public domain dedication). Our derived tables are offered under the same
CC0-1.0 terms. Please cite each NASA PSI investigation by its DOI, as listed
in `README.md` and `data/curated/investigations.csv`.

`data/curated/papers.csv` holds titles, abstracts and links for publications
found through the NASA Technical Reports Server (https://ntrs.nasa.gov). The
documents themselves are not redistributed here, and each keeps its own terms
as stated on its NTRS record.

NASA does not endorse this project.
